translations: [': You, tough child of Kwangtung?', 'of the child whose ancestors hung in the basket above the gap in Sierras, and pushed the dynamite into the scalps?', ', I just want you to change in flour on the wall.', ', your ancestors are now turning in the graves.', 'too much pressure on me you push me.', ", I'm not slave slave. I'm not a slave.", ', I acted as a security guard. I acted as a security guard.', ', I ended up with chop-fércing.', ', I send the house a little lesser of money.', ", I don't have  ⁇ as have to eat.", 'is  ⁇ asto evil.  ⁇ I am  ⁇ asto evil.', ", if I die, I'm fucked up.", ", my family will be in the fuckin' ass.", ': And for the prophet? And for the prophet?', ', what do you mean, what do you mean?', ', however, none of the interested parties did not submit any alternative to any alternative.', ', the revision is based on adjusted capacity data provided by the applicant covering the whole Union industry.', ', revised data are accompanied by references to publicly available data concerning, in particular, unused capacities and capacities of producers who stopped operating due to financial difficulties.', ', as explained above in Section 6 ‘Macroeconomic indicators’, the revised data provide a much more accurate set of capacity data available for the production of biodiesel during the period considered than the data originally provided and published in the provisional Regulation.', ', each mistakes every mistakes, each mistakes, and every mistakes.', ", you know what it's like? Do you know what it's like?", ", for the heavy sins, you've got a lot of fatty.", 'less sins, you can do little for a slight sins, too little.', ', do you understand that you understand?', ', the man killed a boy and I helped him.', ', I was happy to be happy. I was happy.', ', forgive me, forgive me.', ', you have to go to work, you must go to work!', 'Geum-jao, what do those eye shadows mean?', ', you know why those kids, you know why the kids...', ': Hey! Hey! Hey! Hey, hey, hey, hey!', "here's another here! There's more here!", 'do you have a Hello?', ', [5] Communication from the Commission to the European Parliament, the Council, the European Economic and Social Committee and the Committee of the Regions: the Digital Agenda for Europe, COM(2010) 245 final, 28.8.2010.', 'Study in Europe Erasmus and Leonardo da Vinci European Commission Home News Transport and Travel Energy and Natural Resources of the EU in the Cost of Economic, Finance and Tax Culture, Education and Youth Enterprise Regional and local development Justice and civil rights Science and technology Foreign policy EU Employment and social rights Agriculture, fisheries and food Environment, consumer protection and health and trainees abroad?', "Yo, you don't want to see the cellar, fuckers.", ', did it have been shown to you?', ' ⁇  Now look out now, look out.', 'House is not for sale to the house. It is not for sale.', ': So what was it like? What was it like?', 'was it... the experience of the experience?', ', yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah.', ', it certainly was a experience of experience and experience.', ', what is it for the smell of smell?', ', yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah.', ", that's... secret Navy Flowers and...", ', look, is everything all right, all right?', ': No, no.', ': neither nor does it. No, nor does it.', ', in fact, in fact, it is not actually not at all.', ': Application of EU legislation Answer from the Council (3 November 2009)', ', it was supposed to be just a test...', 'Samah stared at Xara with a dazzling fever in his eyes.', ', that was all that was all.', ': a difficult test, a difficult test.', ', it should have taught you humility and patience.', ', it was meant to mitigate your aggressiveness..."', ', weaken us," Xar said quietly, silent.', ', yes," Samah said, slowly bowing his head slowly.', ', weaken you."', ': You were afraid of us."', ', we were afraid of you."', ', you were hoping that we would die..."', ', no."', ', Samah shook his head as he shook his head.', ', Labyrint became an embodiment of this hope.', ', there is nothing bigger or older than the universe.', ', I would like to talk about the following questions:', ', are we in space ourselves in space?', ', pursuant to Articles 46 EC and 55 EC, Articles 43 EC and 49 EC do not preclude the restriction justified grounds of public health.', ", I'm saying what I've heard.", ', even the others heard the other cops.', ', that means that I will go after me by the skipper.', ', hell, hell.', ", that's for the messenger. It's for the messenger. It's for the messenger. It's for the messenger.", ', I have no one with Freeb what to do, just help you. And nobody knows it, except those cops.', ', did they ears it on me?', 'every one has someone. Each one has someone.', ', do you want me to go away?', ", because you told me I'm going to leave, -it's not gonna help.", ", I'm going to go to it from elsewhere.", ', so I should go. So, I should go.', ', glaze, Slava.', 'And you should be careful of your language.', 'Naser naser naser sizes.', ", let's sit here to sit with us!", ", I don't have time to have time.", ': Come with me! Come with me! Come with me!', ", you're eating afterwards.", "! Come on! Let's go! Let's go!", ", don't push me, or I'll give you gender.", ", Oswald, look who's here!", ', no one shall walk behind him after him.', ', but how do you know how? But how? But how does it seem?', ', what are you doing here? What are you doing here?', ', I will teach you to listen to you! I will teach you to listen to you!', ', outside the outside!', ', always by him, he always stands at him.', ', where is Dana? Where is Dane?', ", it's on the roof, on the roof, is on the roof."]
